01:11.900 --> 01:13.833
- THE FIRST 100 CUSTOMERS
- 前 100 名客户

01:13.833 --> 01:15.633
WHO JOIN
BANK OF BIKINI BOTTOM BANK
谁加入
比基尼底部银行

01:15.633 --> 01:18.367
WILL RECEIVE INSTANT INTEREST
ON THEIR DEPOSIT.
将立即收到兴趣
他们的押金。

01:18.367 --> 01:20.567
- INSTANT INTEREST?
- 立即感兴趣？

01:20.567 --> 01:22.967
THAT'S PRACTICALLY
GIVING MONEY AWAY!
这实际上是
捐钱！

01:22.967 --> 01:24.133
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

01:24.133 --> 01:25.167
YOU'RE IN CHARGE
WHILE I RUN DOWN
你负责
当我疲惫不堪时

01:25.167 --> 01:26.700
TO THE BANK
OF BIKINI BOTTOM BANK.
到银行
比基尼底部银行。

01:26.700 --> 01:29.433
I GOT TO GET DOWN THERE
BEFORE THEY RUN OUT OF DOUGH!
我得去那里
在他们用完面团之前！

01:29.433 --> 01:33.600
[car engine revving,
squealing]
[汽车发动机转速，
尖叫]

01:33.600 --> 01:34.967
[screech]
[尖叫]

01:34.967 --> 01:37.600
MONEY, HERE I C--
OOH!
钱，我在这里——
哦！

01:37.600 --> 01:40.967
[overlapping murmuring]
[重叠的低语]

01:40.967 --> 01:42.700
- [jabbering]
- [喋喋不休]

01:42.700 --> 01:45.867
- THANKS FOR BANKING
WITH BANK OF BIKINI BOTTOM BANK.
- 感谢银行服务
带有比基尼底部银行的银行。

01:45.867 --> 01:47.067
AND HERE'S
YOUR INSTANT INTEREST.
这是
您的即时兴趣。

01:47.067 --> 01:48.600
[cash register ka-ching]
[收银嘉庆]

01:48.600 --> 01:51.167
- [jabbers]
- [叽叽喳喳]

01:51.167 --> 01:52.767
[coins jingle]
[金币叮当声]

01:52.767 --> 01:54.833
[jabbers]
[叽叽喳喳]

01:54.833 --> 01:57.300
- FREE MOOLA JUST FOR JOINING?
- 加入即可获得免费 MOOLA？

01:57.300 --> 02:00.067
YES!
- [groans]
是的！
- [呻吟]

02:00.067 --> 02:03.367
I'M IN MONEY HEAVEN!
[laughs]
我在金钱天堂！
[笑]

02:03.367 --> 02:06.067
- HEADS UP.
WE'VE GOT A LIVE ONE.
- 小心。
我们有一个活的。

02:06.067 --> 02:07.200
- WELCOME
TO BANK OF BIKINI--
- 欢迎
前往比基尼银行——

02:07.200 --> 02:09.300
- HI. I WANT
TO SEE ALL YOUR MONEY.
- 你好。我想要
查看您所有的钱。

02:09.300 --> 02:10.400
- EXCUSE ME?
- 打扰一下？

02:10.400 --> 02:11.833
- SHOW ME
WHERE THE MONEY LIVES.
- 告诉我
钱在哪里。

02:11.833 --> 02:13.467
I BET YOU GOT A LOT.
我打赌你一定有很多。

02:13.467 --> 02:14.767
I'D LIKE TO SEE ALL OF IT.
我想看看全部。

02:14.767 --> 02:16.733
[alarm rings]
I'M A HUGE FAN OF MONEY.
[警报响起]
我是金钱的超级粉丝。

02:16.733 --> 02:18.500
OOH! OH! HEY! HEY!
哦！哦！嘿！嘿！

02:18.500 --> 02:20.400
GET YOUR HANDS--
AAH!
握住你的手——
啊啊！

02:20.400 --> 02:21.467
[clang]
[铛]

02:21.467 --> 02:25.300
ANCHOVIES.
凤尾鱼。

02:25.300 --> 02:27.700
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

02:27.700 --> 02:29.100
GOOD DAY, MADAME.
美好的一天，女士。

02:29.100 --> 02:32.267
I WOULD LIKE TO TAKE
A LOOK AT YOUR SAFE, PLEASE.
我想要
请检查一下您的保险箱。

02:32.267 --> 02:33.500
- SURE THING, SIR.
- 当然可以，先生。

02:33.500 --> 02:34.933
[alarm rings]
[警报响起]

02:34.933 --> 02:36.367
- NOT AGAIN.
- 不会再有。

02:36.367 --> 02:38.067
AAH!
啊啊！

02:38.067 --> 02:39.500
[crash]
[碰撞]

02:39.500 --> 02:42.833
SCALLOPS.
扇贝。

02:45.833 --> 02:47.733
[falsetto]
GOOD DAY, GENTLEMEN.
[假声]
先生们，美好的一天。

02:47.733 --> 02:48.800
both: GOOD DAY, MA'AM.
两人：早上好，女士。

02:48.800 --> 02:50.267
- HELLO YOUNG MISSY.
- 你好，年轻的小姐。

02:50.267 --> 02:51.733
- WELL, HELLO, MA'AM.
- 嗯，你好，女士。

02:51.733 --> 02:53.167
HOW CAN WE HELP YOU TODAY?
今天我们能为您提供什么帮助？

02:53.167 --> 02:54.367
- SO FAR, SO GOOD.
- 到目前为止，一切都很好。

02:54.367 --> 02:55.633
- MA'AM?
- 女士？

02:55.633 --> 02:57.067
- THEY HAVEN'T
THROWN ME OUT YET.
- 他们没有
还是把我赶出去吧。

02:57.067 --> 02:58.667
- MA'AM?
- 女士？

02:58.667 --> 03:01.067
- IT'S ALL
COMING TOGETHER NOW.
- 这就是全部
现在就在一起吧。

03:01.067 --> 03:02.167
- CAN I HELP YOU, MA'AM?
- 女士，我可以帮你吗？

03:02.167 --> 03:04.067
A WITHDRAWAL? A TRANSFER?
撤回？转会？

03:04.067 --> 03:05.567
ANYTHING?
任何事物？

03:05.567 --> 03:07.533
FREE INTEREST?
- OOH.
免费利息？
-哦。

03:07.533 --> 03:08.800
[laughs]
YES!
[笑]
是的！

03:08.800 --> 03:10.200
I'LL HAVE THAT PLEASE.
请给我这个。

03:10.200 --> 03:13.067
- OKAY, BUT YOU'LL HAVE
TO MAKE A DEPOSIT FIRST.
- 好吧，但你会有
首先存款。

03:13.067 --> 03:14.400
- OH, OF COURSE!
- 哦，当然！

03:14.400 --> 03:18.300
HERE'S ME PRIZE PENNY
TO DEPOSIT IN A NEW ACCOUNT.
这是我的奖品便士
存入新账户。

03:18.300 --> 03:20.400
- OKAY, I'LL SET IT RIGHT UP.
- 好的，我会安排好。

03:20.400 --> 03:21.833
- [normal voice]
WAIT!
- [正常声音]
等等！

03:21.833 --> 03:23.667
[falsetto]
UH, WHATCHA DOING?
[假声]
呃，在做什么？

03:23.667 --> 03:25.100
PENNY DOESN'T WANT
TO BE CRAMMED IN THERE
佩妮不想要
被挤在那里

03:25.100 --> 03:26.500
WITH ALL THOSE OTHER COINS.
与所有其他硬币。

03:26.500 --> 03:28.700
SHE WANTS A MONEY CONDO
OF HER OWN.
她想要一套货币公寓
她自己的。

03:28.700 --> 03:29.733
- OKAY.
- 好的。

03:29.733 --> 03:31.667
YOU WANT
A SAFE DEPOSIT BOX THEN?
你想要的
那么保险箱呢？

03:31.667 --> 03:32.667
- OH, YES!
- 哦是的！

03:32.667 --> 03:34.067
PENNY WILL HAVE ONE OF THOSE.
佩妮会拥有其中之一。

03:34.067 --> 03:35.367
- UH, THIS WAY, PLEASE.
- 呃，请这边走。

03:35.367 --> 03:37.300
- [plinking tiptoeing]
- [踮起脚尖]

03:37.300 --> 03:39.467
WAIT!
等待！

03:39.467 --> 03:43.233
CAN I HAVE A MOMENT
WITH ME PENNY, ALONE?
能给我一点时间吗
和我一起，佩妮，一个人吗？

03:43.233 --> 03:44.933
- [sighs]
MAKE IT QUICK.
- [叹气]
动作要快。

03:44.933 --> 03:46.600
WE'RE CLOSING
IN FIVE MINUTES.
我们即将结束
五分钟后。

03:46.600 --> 03:47.767
- OH, PENNY.
- 哦，佩妮。

03:47.767 --> 03:49.233
I'M GONNA MISS YOU.
我会想念你的。

03:49.233 --> 03:52.533
[cries]
[哭声]

03:52.533 --> 03:54.133
[sobs]
[抽泣]

03:54.133 --> 03:56.300
IT'S INHUMAN, I TELL YOU!
我告诉你，这是不人道的！

03:56.300 --> 03:58.067
OH, PENNY, PENNY.
哦，佩妮，佩妮。

03:58.067 --> 04:02.467
ONE LAST KISS GOOD-BYE.
最后一吻再见。

04:02.467 --> 04:04.800
[grunts]
[clothes pop]
[咕哝]
[流行衣服]

04:04.800 --> 04:09.067
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:09.067 --> 04:11.133
IT'S JUST YOU AND ME NOW,
LITTLE PENNY.
现在只有你和我，
小便士。

04:11.133 --> 04:13.667
YEESH, OOH, IT'S
A WEE BIT CRAMPED IN HERE.
是的，哦，是的
这里有点拥挤。

04:13.667 --> 04:14.667
[keys jingling]
[钥匙叮当作响]

04:14.667 --> 04:16.500
- OH, WELL, THAT LOOKS SECURE.
- 哦，好吧，看起来很安全。

04:16.500 --> 04:19.200
- WHOA!
- 哇！

04:19.200 --> 04:20.833
- WERE YOU PEOPLE TRAINED
IN A BARN?
- 你们受过训练吗
在谷仓里？

04:20.833 --> 04:22.333
- [gasps]
[heavenly choir vocals]
- [喘气]
【天籁合唱团的歌声】

04:22.333 --> 04:24.067
[gulps]
THIS CAN'T BE TRUE.
[吞咽]
这不可能是真的。

04:24.067 --> 04:25.567
[cash register ka-ching]
[收银嘉庆]

04:25.567 --> 04:28.333
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

04:28.333 --> 04:29.333
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

04:29.333 --> 04:30.733
- 'TIS TRUE!
- 这是真的！

04:30.733 --> 04:34.467
I'VE LANDED
IN MONEY "NIR-VANNER!"
我已经着陆
金钱“NIR-VANNER！”

04:34.467 --> 04:38.433
ME WILDEST DREAM'S
FINALLY COME TRUE!
我最疯狂的梦想
终于成真了！

04:38.433 --> 04:42.300
[laughs wildly]
[cash register ka-ching]
[狂笑]
[收银嘉庆]

04:42.300 --> 04:44.867
- MR. KRABS, I'M DONE
WATERING DOWN THE KETCHUP.
- 先生。蟹蟹，我完成了
兑水番茄酱。

04:44.867 --> 04:45.900
DID YOU WANT ME TO--
你想让我--

04:45.900 --> 04:48.567
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

04:48.567 --> 04:50.967
MR. KRABS?
MR. KRABS?
先生。螃蟹？
先生。螃蟹？

04:50.967 --> 04:52.333
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

04:52.333 --> 04:54.967
- WOULD YOU PIPE DOWN!
- SORRY, SQUIDWARD.
- 你能小声点吗？
- 对不起，章鱼哥。

04:54.967 --> 04:57.367
I CAN'T FIND MR. KRABS,
AND HE SAID HE'D BE RIGHT BACK.
我找不到先生。螃蟹，
他说他马上回来。

04:57.367 --> 04:58.700
I'M GETTING
A LITTLE CONCERNED.
我得到了
有点担心。

04:58.700 --> 04:59.833
- THAT'S NICE.
- 那很好。

04:59.833 --> 05:02.067
AND...INTERESTING.
而且......有趣。

05:02.067 --> 05:03.400
- I CAN'T TAKE IT ANYMORE.
- 我再也受不了了。

05:03.400 --> 05:05.067
I'M GONNA GO LOOK FOR HIM.
我要去找他。

05:05.067 --> 05:06.167
HOLD ON, MR. KRABS.
坚持住，先生。螃蟹。

05:06.167 --> 05:07.600
I'M COMING FOR YOU.
我来找你了。

05:07.600 --> 05:08.600
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:08.600 --> 05:10.700
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

05:10.700 --> 05:13.433
[singsong]
MR. KRABS!
[单曲]
先生。螃蟹！

05:13.433 --> 05:16.067
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

05:16.067 --> 05:18.700
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

05:18.700 --> 05:20.367
[squishing footfall]
[踩踏脚步声]

05:20.367 --> 05:22.867
- WELL, TIME TO HEAD HOME.
WHOO-HOO!
- 好吧，该回家了。
呼呼！

05:22.867 --> 05:24.100
I HOPE TO SEE EACH
AND EVERY ONE OF YOU
我希望能看到每一个人
以及你们每一个人

05:24.100 --> 05:25.167
ON THE OUTSIDE.
在外面。

05:25.167 --> 05:28.233
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:28.233 --> 05:29.900
WAIT!
[grunts]
等待！
[咕哝]

05:29.900 --> 05:31.200
BLIMEY, I'M LOCKED IN!
天哪，我被锁在里面了！

05:31.200 --> 05:34.400
[grunts] I GUESS
I'M TRAPPED HERE ALL NIGHT.
[咕噜声]我猜
我整晚都被困在这里。

05:34.400 --> 05:36.867
[honk]
WITH ALL THIS MOOLA.
[鸣喇叭]
有了所有这些莫拉。

05:36.867 --> 05:39.800
[sighs]
SO MUCH MOOLA.
[叹气]
这么多穆拉。

05:43.200 --> 05:44.733
BUT NO ONE TO TELL ABOUT IT!
但没有人告诉我们这件事！

05:44.733 --> 05:48.867
TIME TO RUSTLE ME UP
SOME FRIENDS!
是时候让我兴奋起来了
一些朋友！

05:48.867 --> 05:50.300
[knock at door]
[敲门]

05:50.300 --> 05:51.733
- OH, HI, PEARL.
- 哦，嗨，珍珠。

05:51.733 --> 05:53.600
IS MR. KRABS HERE?
- NO.
是先生。螃蟹来了？
- 不。

05:53.600 --> 05:55.333
- PEARL, I HATE TO BE THE ONE
TO TELL YOU THIS,
- 珀尔，我讨厌成为那个人
告诉你这一点，

05:55.333 --> 05:56.700
BUT MR. KRABS IS MISSING!
但是先生。蟹不见了！

05:56.700 --> 05:58.800
- OH, MY GOSH.
- I KNOW!
- 哦，天哪。
- 我知道！

05:58.800 --> 06:00.300
- OH, MY GOSH.
- 哦，天哪。

06:00.300 --> 06:01.800
- DON'T WORRY,
I'LL FIND HIM.
- 别担心，
我会找到他的。

06:01.800 --> 06:02.833
- OH, MY GOSH!
- 哦，天哪！

06:02.833 --> 06:05.700
CALL HIM ON HIS CELL!
[dial tone]
用手机给他打电话！
[拨号音]

06:05.700 --> 06:08.933
[gentle jazz music]
[轻柔的爵士乐]

06:08.933 --> 06:10.067
**
**
**
**
**
**
**
