06:10.067 --> 06:12.167
- YOU LOOK
ABSOLUTELY STUNNING TONIGHT,
- 你看
今晚绝对令人惊叹，

06:12.167 --> 06:14.167
MRS. GREENBACK.
太太。美元。

06:14.167 --> 06:15.600
[snaps claw]
WAITER!
[折爪]
服务员！

06:15.600 --> 06:16.867
[assumes French accent]
OUI, OUI, MONSIEUR.
[假设有法国口音]
哎呀，哎呀，先生。

06:16.867 --> 06:19.633
WHAT CAN I GET YOU
AND THE LADY TONIGHT?
我能给你什么
今晚那位女士呢？

06:19.633 --> 06:20.633
THE LADY WOULD LIKE
女士想要

06:20.633 --> 06:22.633
TO START
WITH A MILLION CLAMS,
开始
配上百万只蛤蜊，

06:22.633 --> 06:24.700
A SIDE OF INVESTMENTS,
投资的一方面，

06:24.700 --> 06:27.533
AND HOLD THE TAXES.
并保留税收。

06:27.533 --> 06:28.567
I'LL HAVE THE SAME.
我也会有同样的。

06:28.567 --> 06:30.933
BUT WITH EXTRA "NO TAXES."
但有额外的“无税”。

06:30.933 --> 06:33.533
[sighs]
SUCH A FRIENDLY FELLOW.
[叹气]
真是个友善的家伙。

06:33.533 --> 06:34.767
GOOD-LOOKING TOO.
也好看。

06:34.767 --> 06:36.467
I'M ALMOST GONNA REGRET
NOT LEAVING HIM A TIP.
我快要后悔了
不给他小费。

06:36.467 --> 06:37.567
[cell phone rings]
[手机响]

06:37.567 --> 06:39.100
[beep]
HELLO.
[嘟嘟声]
你好。

06:39.100 --> 06:40.667
- MR. KRABS, ARE YOU OKAY?
- 先生。蟹蟹，你还好吗？

06:40.667 --> 06:42.067
- I'M FINE, BOY!
- 我很好，孩子！

06:42.067 --> 06:43.667
IN FACT, I'M DANCING
WITH A BEAUTIFUL LADY!
事实上，我在跳舞
和一位美丽的女士一起！

06:43.667 --> 06:44.933
- OH, THAT'S NICE.
- 哦，那很好。

06:44.933 --> 06:47.233
- YES, AND SHE'S MADE
ENTIRELY OUT OF MONEY.
- 是的，她已经成功了
完全没钱了。

06:47.233 --> 06:48.767
- WHAT? WHERE ARE YOU?
- 什么？你在哪里？

06:48.767 --> 06:51.767
- I'M LOCKED IN THE BANK VAULT
AND HAVING THE TIME OF ME LIFE!
- 我被锁在银行金库里
享受我生命中的时光！

06:51.767 --> 06:53.700
OH, AND I THINK
I'M RUNNING OUT OF OXYGEN,
哦，我想
我的氧气快用完了

06:53.700 --> 06:54.967
AND IT'S MAKING ME
LOSE MY MIND.
这让我
失去理智。

06:54.967 --> 06:57.133
- I'VE GOTTA SAVE MR. KRABS!
- 我得救先生。螃蟹！

06:57.133 --> 06:59.133
PATRICK!
[pop]
帕特里克！
[流行音乐]

06:59.133 --> 07:00.833
PATRICK, YOU GOTTA
HELP ME, BUDDY!
帕特里克，你必须
帮帮我，伙计！

07:00.833 --> 07:03.767
- [slurps]
- I NEED TO BREAK INTO A BANK.
- [啜饮]
- 我需要闯入一家银行。

07:05.967 --> 07:06.967
- WHAT?
- 什么？

07:06.967 --> 07:09.433
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝。

07:09.433 --> 07:12.067
WE HAVE BEEN FRIENDS
FOR A LONG TIME.
我们一直是朋友
很长一段时间。

07:12.067 --> 07:15.400
AND YOU'VE ASKED ME
TO DO SOME CRAZY THINGS
你问过我
做一些疯狂的事情

07:15.400 --> 07:16.467
OVER THE YEARS.
历年。

07:16.467 --> 07:19.833
BUT BREAKING INTO A BANK...
但闯入银行......

07:19.833 --> 07:22.400
HAS TO BE THE COOLEST!
一定是最酷的！

07:22.400 --> 07:25.200
[lilting Hawaiian music]
[轻快的夏威夷音乐]

07:25.200 --> 07:27.300
- AH, THIS IS THE LIFE.
- 啊，这就是生活。

07:27.300 --> 07:29.600
SUN, SAND AND SURF.
阳光、沙滩和冲浪。

07:29.600 --> 07:34.200
AND, OF COURSE,
MRS. GREENBACK BY MY SIDE.
当然，
夫人。美元在我身边。

07:34.200 --> 07:36.567
WHAT'S THAT?
那是什么？

07:36.567 --> 07:38.233
OH, DON'T START ON ME NOW.
哦，现在别对我下手。

07:38.233 --> 07:40.767
I'M SURE THIS REMOTE ISLAND
HAS A FOOD SOURCE.
我确信这个偏远的岛屿
有食物来源。

07:40.767 --> 07:43.100
OLD KRABS JUST HASN'T
FOUND IT YET, THAT'S ALL.
老蟹还没有
已经找到了，仅此而已。

07:43.100 --> 07:44.400
I'LL JUST...
我就……

07:44.400 --> 07:45.767
[laughs nervously]
[紧张地笑]

07:45.767 --> 07:47.133
SO HUNGRY.
好饿。

07:47.133 --> 07:50.133
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

07:50.133 --> 07:51.767
- COAST IS CLEAR.
- 海岸清澈。

07:51.767 --> 07:52.900
WHAT'S THE PLAN, BUDDY?
有什么计划，伙计？

07:52.900 --> 07:55.667
- OKAY, FIRST,
WE CLIMB UP THE WALLS.
- 好吧，首先，
我们爬上墙。

07:55.667 --> 07:58.600
THEN, WE SLIDE
DOWN THE CHIMNEY
然后，我们滑行
下烟囱

07:58.600 --> 08:00.067
AND EAT UP
ALL THE MILK AND COOKIES
吃掉
所有的牛奶和饼干

08:00.067 --> 08:01.567
THEY LEFT OUT FOR US!
他们为我们留下了！

08:01.567 --> 08:02.833
- WELL, I DON'T SEE A CHIMNEY,
- 嗯，我没有看到烟囱，

08:02.833 --> 08:04.933
BUT WE COULD TRY GETTING IN
THROUGH A ROOF VENT.
但我们可以尝试进入
通过屋顶通风口。

08:04.933 --> 08:07.533
IF ONLY WE HAD A WAY
TO SCALE THIS WALL.
要是我们有办法就好了
攀登这堵墙。

08:07.533 --> 08:11.233
- LUCKILY, I BROUGHT
THE BANK BREAK-IN KIT.
- 幸运的是，我带来了
银行闯入工具包。

08:11.233 --> 08:14.267
UH...
呃……

08:14.267 --> 08:15.400
HOW ABOUT THIS?
这个怎么样？

08:15.400 --> 08:16.800
- A BUNCH OF OLD SHOELACES?
- 一串旧鞋带？

08:16.800 --> 08:20.700
- IT'S AS CLOSE AS I'LL EVER GET
TO HAVING SHOES.
- 这是我能得到的最接近的结果
要有鞋子。

08:20.700 --> 08:22.167
- I WISH WE HAD
SOMETHING STRONGER,
- 我希望我们有
更强大的东西，

08:22.167 --> 08:24.667
BUT THIS'LL HAVE TO DO.
但这是必须要做的。

08:27.067 --> 08:31.700
[screaming]
[rope snapping]
[尖叫]
[绳子断裂]

08:31.700 --> 08:33.600
- HEY, SPONGEBOB,
I GOT AN IDEA!
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，
我有一个主意！

08:33.600 --> 08:37.133
LET'S USE THIS GRAPPLING HOOK.
让我们使用这个抓钩。

08:37.133 --> 08:38.567
[hook clanks]
[钩子叮当作响]

08:38.567 --> 08:40.100
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

08:40.100 --> 08:43.333
[plinking tiptoeing]
[踮起脚尖]

08:44.800 --> 08:46.967
- THIS VENT WILL SURELY
LEAD US STRAIGHT TO MR. KRABS.
- 这个通风口肯定会
带我们直接去找先生。螃蟹。

08:46.967 --> 08:48.433
- LET'S GET HIM!
- 让我们抓住他！

08:48.433 --> 08:49.467
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:49.467 --> 08:51.433
[screaming]
[thumping]
[尖叫]
[重击]

08:51.433 --> 08:53.700
[crash]
[screaming, thumping]
[崩溃]
[screaming, thumping]

08:53.700 --> 08:55.900
[crash]
[screaming, thumping]
[崩溃]
[尖叫声、重击声]

08:55.900 --> 08:58.133
[whoosh, crash]
[嗖嗖，崩溃]

08:58.133 --> 09:00.567
COOL!
LET'S DO THAT AGAIN!
凉爽的！
让我们再做一次！

09:00.567 --> 09:02.167
- NOT NOW, PATRICK,
WE'RE RUNNING OUT OF TIME.
- 现在不行，帕特里克，
我们的时间不多了。

09:02.167 --> 09:03.300
AND, MORE IMPORTANTLY,
而且，更重要的是，

09:03.300 --> 09:04.933
MR. KRABS IS RUNNING OUT
OF OXYGEN.
先生。螃蟹快卖完了
氧气。

09:04.933 --> 09:05.933
- [plinking tiptoeing]
- [踮起脚尖]

09:05.933 --> 09:07.167
[jabbering]
[叽叽喳喳]

09:07.167 --> 09:10.400
SO HUNGRY.
好饿。

09:10.400 --> 09:12.233
OH, WHY DID I COME
哦，我为什么来

09:12.233 --> 09:14.300
TO THIS
UNINHABITABLE-BLE ISLAND?
对此
不适宜居住的布莱岛？

09:14.300 --> 09:16.367
WHY DID I DO IT?
我为什么这么做？

09:16.367 --> 09:18.600
WHAT? HUH?
什么？嗯？

09:18.600 --> 09:22.433
WHY DID I SAY ALL THAT
TO MRS. GREENBACK?
我为什么这么说
致夫人。美元？

09:22.433 --> 09:24.133
I-I MISS HER.
我-我想念她。

09:24.133 --> 09:26.700
WHY ISN'T SHE--
MRS. GREENBACK!
为什么她不是——
夫人。美元！

09:26.700 --> 09:28.900
[claws clacking]
WHERE CAN SHE BE?
[爪子嘎嘎作响]
她会在哪里？

09:28.900 --> 09:30.433
WHAT HAVE I DONE?
我做了什么？

09:30.433 --> 09:32.367
OH. OH, MRS. GREENBACK!
哦。哦，夫人。美元！

09:32.367 --> 09:34.533
MRS. GREENBACK!
YOU'RE OKAY!
太太。美元！
你没事吧！

09:34.533 --> 09:36.400
I-I WAS SO WORRIED.
我-我太担心了。

09:36.400 --> 09:37.633
I'M SO SORRY.
我很抱歉。

09:37.633 --> 09:39.333
YOU MUST NEVER RUN AWAY
LIKE THAT AGAIN.
你绝对不能逃跑
又这样。

09:39.333 --> 09:40.400
[wind whooshes]
[风呼啸]

09:40.400 --> 09:42.100
WHAT'S THIS?
[screams]
这是什么？
[尖叫声]

09:42.100 --> 09:43.133
LITTLE MISS!
小小姐！

09:43.133 --> 09:44.467
WHAT THE NEPTUNE?
海王星是什么？

09:44.467 --> 09:46.567
- [inhaling loudly]
- A SLIMY MONEY DRAGON!
- [大声吸气]
- 一条粘糊糊的金钱龙！

09:46.567 --> 09:48.667
YOU'RE NOT SUCKING AWAY
ME FORTUNE WITHOUT A FIGHT!
你没有吸走
我的财富无需战斗！

09:48.667 --> 09:49.767
[punches]
[拳头]

09:49.767 --> 09:50.900
[vacuum sucking]
[真空吸附]

09:50.900 --> 09:55.067
GIVE ME BACK MRS. GREENBACK,
YOU BEAST!
把我还给我 夫人美元，
你这个野兽！

09:55.067 --> 09:56.133
- PATRICK, YOU READY?
- 帕特里克，你准备好了吗？

09:56.133 --> 09:59.533
- THIS LOCK WON'T KNOW
WHAT HIT IT.
- 这把锁不会知道
是什么击中了它。

09:59.533 --> 10:01.667
- UH, CAREFUL, PATRICK.
- 呃，小心，帕特里克。

10:01.667 --> 10:02.700
USE FINESSE.
运用技巧。

10:02.700 --> 10:03.900
- OH, RIGHT.
- 哦，对了。

10:03.900 --> 10:06.200
[clank]
I'LL USE THE FINESSE.
[叮当声]
我会运用技巧。

10:06.200 --> 10:09.833
[engine revving,
tool clanks]
[发动机转速，
工具叮当声]

10:09.833 --> 10:11.167
- GOOD MORNING, GENTLEMEN.
- 早上好，先生们。

10:11.167 --> 10:12.600
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:12.600 --> 10:14.167
- WE'VE BEEN RUMBLED!
- 我们被打扰了！

10:14.167 --> 10:15.333
RUN! SCATTER!
跑步！分散！

10:15.333 --> 10:17.033
SCAMPER! SAVE YOURSELF!
疾走！救救自己吧！

10:17.033 --> 10:19.000
- WHAT'S ALL THIS ABOUT?
- 这是怎么回事？

10:19.000 --> 10:22.500
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

10:22.500 --> 10:24.833
- WELL...
- 出色地...

10:24.833 --> 10:26.933
- MAY I HELP YOU
WITH ANYTHING, SIR?
- 我可以帮助你吗
有什么事吗，先生？

10:26.933 --> 10:28.867
- AH, YES, I NEED
TO MAKE A WITHDRAWAL.
- 啊，是的，我需要
提款。

10:28.867 --> 10:31.200
I NEED TO WITHDRAW
ONE MR. KRABS.
我需要退出
一位先生。螃蟹。

10:31.200 --> 10:33.500
- I ASSURE YOU,
MR. SQUAREPANTS,
- 我向你保证，
先生。方裤，

10:33.500 --> 10:35.833
WE RECEIVED NO SUCH DEPOSIT.
我们没有收到此类押金。

10:35.833 --> 10:36.867
[lock clanking]
[锁叮当作响]

10:36.867 --> 10:38.867
[door hinge creaks]
[gasps]
[门铰链吱吱作响]
[喘气]

10:38.867 --> 10:42.100
- I'VE GOT YOU NOW,
MONEY-SUCKER!
- 我现在找到你了，
吸钱者！

10:42.100 --> 10:44.200
[vacuum sucking]
THAT DOES IT, LIZARD BREATH!
[真空吸附]
就是这样，蜥蜴呼吸！

10:44.200 --> 10:46.533
IT'S YOU OR ME NOW.
现在是你还是我。

10:46.533 --> 10:48.267
JUST YOU AND ME.
只有你和我。

10:48.267 --> 10:53.500
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:53.500 --> 10:54.667
YAH!
[sucking stops]
啊！
[吸吮停止]

10:54.667 --> 10:57.200
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

10:57.200 --> 11:00.900
[hysterical laugh]
[歇斯底里的笑声]

11:00.900 --> 11:04.233
OOH!
* I CONQUERED THE MONEY DRAGON
哦！
*我征服了金钱龙

11:04.233 --> 11:05.433
VICTORY! WHOO!
胜利！哇！

11:05.433 --> 11:06.533
- [teeth chattering]
- [牙齿打颤]

11:06.533 --> 11:08.233
SECURITY!
安全！

11:08.233 --> 11:09.867
[keys jingling]
[钥匙叮当作响]

11:09.867 --> 11:12.367
[musical splatting]
[音乐泼溅]

11:12.367 --> 11:15.767
AND DON'T FORGET YOUR...
[sighs] DEPOSIT.
并且不要忘记您的...
[叹气]存款。

11:15.767 --> 11:17.067
[penny clinks]
[便士叮当声]

11:17.067 --> 11:18.567
- YOU KNOW, BOYO,
- 你知道，男孩，

11:18.567 --> 11:20.467
THROUGH THIS WHOLE ORDEAL,
经过这整个磨难，

11:20.467 --> 11:23.200
I'VE LEARNED
A LITTLE SOMETHING ABOUT GREED.
我已经学会了
关于贪婪的一些知识。

11:23.200 --> 11:25.433
A LITTLE SOMETHING
ABOUT ISOLATION.
一点点
关于隔离。

11:25.433 --> 11:29.167
[chuckles] EVEN A LITTLE
SOMETHING ABOUT LOVE.
[轻笑]哪怕一点点
关于爱的一些事情。

11:29.167 --> 11:31.433
AND YOU KNOW WHAT I REALIZE,
THROUGH IT ALL?
你知道我意识到了什么，
经历这一切？

11:31.433 --> 11:33.767
- THAT YOU CAN'T
PUT A PRICE ON FREEDOM?
- 你不能
为自由定价？

11:33.767 --> 11:35.733
- BARNACLES, NO, BOY!
- 藤壶，不，孩子！

11:35.733 --> 11:39.633
I REALIZE THAT THEY DIDN'T
PAY INTEREST ON ME DEPOSIT!
我意识到他们没有
对我的存款支付利息！

11:39.633 --> 11:40.967
HEY, YOU CHEAPSKATES!
嘿，你们这些小气鬼！

11:40.967 --> 11:42.367
GIMME ME INTEREST!
给我兴趣！

11:42.367 --> 11:43.600
[penny clinks]
[便士叮当声]

11:43.600 --> 11:44.733
WELL!
出色地！

11:44.733 --> 11:46.200
WHAT DO YOU KNOW?
你知道什么？

11:46.200 --> 11:47.900
I DOUBLED ME MONEY.
我把钱加倍了。

11:47.900 --> 11:50.333
[chortles]
[咯咯笑]

11:52.833 --> 11:56.333
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

[轻快的尤克里里音乐]